---
title: Saga rejection paths - validation failure, insufficient stock, expiry
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant O as order-service
  participant I as inventory-service
  participant K as Kafka
  Note over O,I: Path 1 - validation says a line is invalid
  O->>I: POST /internal/products/validate
  I-->>O: valid=false (NOT_FOUND, INACTIVE or INSUFFICIENT_STOCK)
  O->>O: CREATED to REJECTED, statusReason copied, OrderRejected only
  Note over O,I: Path 2 - lost the race for stock after validation
  O->>K: ReserveInventory
  K->>I: ReserveInventory
  I->>I: conditional UPDATE affects 0 rows, reservation row FAILED
  I->>K: InventoryReservationFailed (shortages)
  K->>O: InventoryReservationFailed
  O->>O: VALIDATED to REJECTED, OrderRejected
  Note over O,I: Path 3 - reservation expires (TTL 900 s default)
  I->>I: ReservationExpiryJob: RESERVED to EXPIRED, reserved decreases
  I->>K: InventoryReleased (reason EXPIRED)
  K->>O: InventoryReleased EXPIRED
  O->>O: VALIDATED or INVENTORY_RESERVED to FAILED, OrderFailed
